                                "sense_id": "da719f2b-bc22-3e8b-a379-0e217bb38182",
                                "text": "If the ore body shows only one stage of economically important mineralization yet contains minerals which are typical of, for example, both hypothermal and mesothermal conditions, it is classified under both headings."
                            },
